{"id":"664309","name":"芋仔耙鸡爪","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664309/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芋仔","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芋仔去皮洗净备用。","img":"images/664309/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡爪去甲洗净。","img":"images/664309/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鸡爪冷水下锅焯烫后洗净。","img":"images/664309/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生姜洗净切片。","img":"images/664309/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/664309/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入火锅底料翻炒。","img":"images/664309/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鸡爪翻炒均匀。","img":"images/664309/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"适量老抽，蚝油，盐翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/664309/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"芋仔放入高压锅中。","img":"images/664309/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入炒过的鸡爪。","img":"images/664309/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664309/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"高压锅大火煮开转中小火压10分钟左右。","img":"images/664309/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"焖好的芋仔鸡爪盛入碗中，放入葱花淋上热油即可。","img":"images/664309/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664309/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664309/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}